************************* Rate Limiter ************************

What is a rate Limiter

            Requests
client    ----------->         server


if client ends too many requests simultaneously , it can crash the server

So rate limiting, limiting the nmber of call you can do.

many companies set limit like 2 requests/sec
so client will be able to do only 2 requests per second.

Why do we even need a Rate Limiter???

-to prevent resource starvation which can cause DOS(denial of service attack)
-to reduce the cost
-to prevent server overload


